Cell["\<\
Define the induced metric $m3tric_{ab}$ on the spatial slice \
$\[CapitalSigma]_t$. The spatial metric is induced from $m4tric_{ab}$ using \
the vector $n^a$ normal to the hypersurface. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.571487777194007*^9, 3.571487985602668*^9}, {
   3.705385929034724*^9, 3.705385930593234*^9}, {3.705385979096553*^9, 
