Cell["\<\
Full spatial projection of the trace-reversed Einstein equations substituting \
the expressions obtained above -> equation for the extrinsic curvature: \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.847297848552773*^9, 
  3.847297912068055*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"edf1fe53-3da6-431a-aaa5-\
0e9f69f2916a"],

